#. type: appendix
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mirrors/_index.adoc:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The official mirrors of the FreeBSD project are made up of many machines "
"operated by the project cluster administrators and behind GeoDNS to direct "
"users to the closest available mirror.  Current locations are Australia, "
"Brazil, France, Japan (two sites), Malaysia, South Africa, Sweden, Taiwan, "
"United States of America (California - two sites, Illinois - two sites, New "
"Jersey, and Washington)."
msgstr "FreeBSD 项目的官方镜像站由许多机器组成，这些机器由项目集群管理员运营，并通过 GeoDNS 将用户引导至最近的可用镜像站。当前位置包括澳大利亚、巴西、法国、日本（两个站点）、马来西亚、南非、瑞典、中国台湾，以及美国（加利福尼亚州两个站点、伊利诺伊州两个站点、新泽西州和华盛顿州）。"

